#### 5.4.3 Module Federation Configuration

Module Federation is the recommended integration mechanism for all micro-frontends regardless of framework:

**Shell Configuration** (React):

```javascript
// webpack.config.js (Shell Application)
module.exports = {
  plugins: [
    new ModuleFederationPlugin({
      name: 'shell',
      remotes: {
        claims: 'claims@https://cdn.gainwell.com/claims/latest/remoteEntry.js',
        provider: 'provider@https://cdn.gainwell.com/provider/latest/remoteEntry.js',
        member: 'member@https://cdn.gainwell.com/member/latest/remoteEntry.js',
      },
      shared: {
        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^18.2.0' },
        'react-dom': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^18.2.0' },
        'react-router-dom': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^6.8.0' },
        '@gainwell/design-system': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^2.0.0' },
      },
    }),
  ],
};
```

**Micro-Frontend Configuration** (React):

```javascript
// webpack.config.js (Claims Micro-Frontend)
module.exports = {
  plugins: [
    new ModuleFederationPlugin({
      name: 'claims',
      filename: 'remoteEntry.js',
      exposes: {
        './ClaimsApp': './src/ClaimsApp',
        './ClaimsRouter': './src/routes',
      },
      shared: {
        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^18.2.0' },
        'react-dom': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^18.2.0' },
        'react-router-dom': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^6.8.0' },
        '@gainwell/design-system': { singleton: true, requiredVersion: '^2.0.0' },
      },
    }),
  ],
};
```

**Key Configuration Principles**:

- **Singleton Shared Dependencies**: React, React DOM, and React Router must be singletons to ensure only one instance is loaded
- **Semantic Versioning**: Use semantic version ranges to allow compatible updates without breaking integration
- **Design System Sharing**: Shared component library must be singleton to ensure visual consistency
- **Exposed Modules**: Micro-frontends expose their root component and routing configuration for shell integration

